    "enUS": {
      "description": "The Gelkis think our centaur mother, Theradras, protects us.  They are stupid.  No one protects the centaur.  The Magram do not need protection!  We are the strongest!\n\nShow the Gelkis they are stupid.  Go to the cave in their village.  They hoard crystals in that cave, the tears of Theradras.  Destroy the tears and bring me the broken pieces!",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{standing} / Friendly Magram Clan Centaur",
          "type": "reputation"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Maintain your reputation with the Magram, and bring 3 Broken Tears to Warug in the Magram Village.",
